description:
RideGo is built for rideshare drivers who want to evaluate ride offers faster, understand their real estimated earnings and stay more focused on the road.

Try RideGo free with 6 ride offers from apps such as Uber, Bolt, Lyft, FREENOW and other compatible ridesharing platforms before choosing a subscription.

RideGo reads the information visible on the screen and displays a compact calculation card with useful estimates for each detected offer:

• estimated earnings per hour;
• estimated earnings per kilometer or mile;
• total estimated time and distance;
• estimated ride cost;
• estimated profit.

You can configure your own vehicle costs, fuel or energy consumption and evaluation thresholds so the results better reflect your real driving situation.

Stay focused with RideGo Voice

When a compatible ride offer is detected, RideGo can use voice feedback to tell you key information about the offer and its evaluation. This helps reduce the need to constantly look at the ph

